[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0316","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0316.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0381","title":"Gossamer Threads DBMan 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Gossamer Threads DBMan 2.0.4 的 db.cgi CGI 脚本存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在 db 参数中引用一个不存在的数据库名称，触发脚本返回环境变量及配置信息等敏感数据，导致系统信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。攻击者利用泄露的信息可进一步探测目标系统环境，为后续攻击提供情报支撑。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0381"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"升级 Gossamer Threads DBMan 至 2.0.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 db.cgi 对无效 db 参数返回环境变量和配置信息的问题。如无法升级，修改 db.cgi 脚本，在查询参数中 db 值对应的数据库不存在时仅返回通用错误页面而非调试信息，同时在 Web 服务器层限制对 db.cgi 的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0067.html","http://www.perfectotech.com/blackwatchlabs/vul5_05.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1178","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19903","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0381.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0381","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0381.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0381.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4d465198ab8436491a7618e7789ef7adce4c01e0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xgg5-44qv-95wx/GHSA-xgg5-44qv-95wx.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0381.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001352.txt","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/pre2008/dbman_cgi.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0316.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0316.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0316.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1106","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0428","title":"趋势科技 InterScan Virus Wall SMTP 网关缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Trend Micro InterScan VirusWall 3.32 及更早版本的 SMTP 网关存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送包含超长文件名的 uuencode 编码附件触发缓冲区溢出，无需身份认证即可在目标系统上以系统权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 InterScan VirusWall 3.32 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H），属于严重级别。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发，通过构造超长文件名的 uuencode 附件发送至目标 SMTP 网关即可触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码，Trend Micro 已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0428"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Trend Micro InterScan Virus Wall 3.33 或更高版本（官方已发布修补补丁）。如无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面封锁 SMTP 端口（25/587）仅允许受信邮件服务器访问、限制邮件附件大小上限至 10MB 以下、在邮件网关启用附件类型过滤拦截 uuencode 编码附件、部署 IPS 规则拦截超长文件名 payload、联系 Trend Micro 技术支持获取官方补丁包及部署指导文档。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.nai.com/nai_labs/asp_set/advisory/39_Trend.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1168","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0428.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0428.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0428","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0428.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0428.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wc7h-rjv2-pvjh/GHSA-wc7h-rjv2-pvjh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0428.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0428.md","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0456","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0456.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0422","title":"Netwin DMailWeb CGI 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netwin DMailWeb CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 utoken 参数提交超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在目标服务器上以 CGI 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Netwin DMailWeb 相关版本，攻击无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0422"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 Netwin DMailWeb CGI 程序至 2.5e 或更高版本，可从 ftp://ftp.netwinsite.com/pub/dmailweb/beta/ 获取。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面限制对 dmailweb/dmailweb.exe 的访问，或对 utoken 参数长度进行输入校验（限制不超过 256 字符）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95749276827558&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1171","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0422.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0422","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0422.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0422.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h7mr-chr8-q245/GHSA-h7mr-chr8-q245.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0422.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1171/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b12a3924bcdfa7af53ab2da329173ee04bf863bc/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0456.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0446","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0446.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0414","title":"HP HP-UX shutdown 命令本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.X 及 10.X 系统中的 shutdown 命令存在本地权限提升漏洞，由于该命令在处理用户提供的畸形输入变量时未进行充分的边界检查与过滤，导致攻击者可通过精心构造的环境变量或命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出或参数注入。本地攻击者只需拥有系统普通用户权限即可利用该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 root 权限，完全控制目标系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性受损。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0414"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39Z","remediation":"建议升级至 HP-UX 11i v3 (11.31) 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。对于仍运行 HP-UX 10.X/11.0/11.11 的系统，作为临时缓解措施，可限制 shutdown 命令的执行权限，仅允许 root 用户执行：`chmod 700 /sbin/shutdown`，并监控 `/var/adm/syslog` 中异常的 shutdown 调用记录。HP 已停止对 10.X 和 11.0 的安全支持，建议尽快迁移至受支持版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0047.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1214","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0414.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0414","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0414.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0414.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-46x7-g574-2w2v/GHSA-46x7-g574-2w2v.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0414.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001348.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2f1f2968-6301-4668-93a2-4a7892409d4d.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0446.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0350","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0427","title":"Aladdin Knowledge Systems eToken PIN 提取漏洞","description":"Aladdin Knowledge Systems eToken 3.3.3 设备存在 PIN 提取漏洞。攻击者仅需物理接触设备，即可通过修改 EEPROM 中的数据重置目标设备的 PIN 码，从而绕过 PIN 保护机制，非法获取设备存储的所有敏感信息，包括信用卡 PIN、密码等机密数据。该漏洞利用设备内部PIN存储机制的缺陷，攻击者无需得知原始PIN即可访问全部机密信息，严重威胁了用户的身份认证安全。该设备支持多种金融认证应用，广泛应用于银行、支付系统等领域，漏洞影响范围涵盖所有使用该型号设备的用户。攻击条件为：攻击者必须具备对设备的物理接触权限，可随时执行PIN提取操作。该漏洞CVSS评分4.6，安全等级中低，表明其影响虽有限，但一旦被利用，将导致严重数据泄露风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0427"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42Z","remediation":"建议立即更换为Aladdin eToken 4.0及以上版本或厂商最新硬件令牌，启用防篡改物理外壳与密封标签防止物理接触攻击，配合双因子认证（PIN+生物识别）作为额外防护层，并定期审计设备物理完整性与固件完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/etoken-piepa.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/3266","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1170","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19894","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0427.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0427.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0427","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0427.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0427.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3hmx-5jq6-252x/GHSA-3hmx-5jq6-252x.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0427.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001350.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0353","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0430","title":"Cart32 Cart32 3.0 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cart32 3.0 购物车软件存在管理信息泄露漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可通过在 URL 请求中追加 \"/expdate\" 路径，直接访问敏感的调试和管理调试信息。该漏洞源于 Cart32 3.0 未对特定调试端点进行访问控制，导致敏感管理信息泄露。攻击条件为远程网络访问、低攻击复杂度、无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），影响机密性部分丧失，不影响完整性和可用性。攻击者可利用该漏洞获取系统调试信息，辅助进一步攻击。影响范围为 Cart32 3.0 版本购物车软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0430"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Cart32 3.0 之后的最新版本（官方已停止维护 3.0 版本），或迁移至现代电商平台（如 Shopify、Magento、WooCommerce 等）。若暂时无法升级，请在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截所有包含 `/expdate` 路径的请求，并限制管理后台仅允许受信 IP 访问。建议同时在 WAF 层面添加规则拦截包含 `expdate` 路径的请求，并审计服务器日志排查是否已被利用泄露调试信息。建议尽快完成电商系统迁移，彻底淘汰不再维护的 Cart32 3.0 组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95738697301956&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1358","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20019","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0430.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0430","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0430.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1910cec3a272a9634d53e73996abe765ad48da86/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0430.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-27gf-ff72-jfqr/GHSA-27gf-ff72-jfqr.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0430.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--efd046f1-024d-4bf2-9072-81c8e0adf4b5.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0353.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0353.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0349","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0345","title":"Cisco IOS 路由器在线帮助系统信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco 路由器在线帮助系统存在信息泄露漏洞。低权限（非 enable 模式）的本地攻击者可通过在 CLI 界面中执行 show 命令，利用帮助系统选项获取敏感配置信息。该漏洞影响 Cisco 2500/2600/3600/4000/7200/7500 系列路由器及 IOS 系统，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击者需已获得本地访问权限方可利用，无法远程触发。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0345"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:31Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至不受影响版本（如 12.0(5) 及以上），或通过全局配置模式使用 `no service help` 命令禁用在线帮助系统。同时配置 privilege 级别限制，将 `show` 命令的访问权限绑定至 privilege level 15，防止低权限用户通过 `show` 命令获取敏感配置信息。如无法立即升级，可在 line vty 下配置 `privilege level 15` 限制非授权用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1161","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000502222246.28423.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0345.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0345","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0345.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c652-vf4r-c57r/GHSA-c652-vf4r-c57r.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0345.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4bfaecb4-0e8f-4414-a9a8-523f28f28202.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0345.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1161/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0346","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0346.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0425","title":"L-Soft LISTSERV 1.8 Web Archives 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"L-Soft LISTSERV 1.8 Web Archives 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Web Archives 组件发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 L-Soft LISTSERV 1.8 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、机密性/完整性/可用性影响均为完全。攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，实现远程代码执行，完全控制目标服务器。ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码（EDB-19893）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0425"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 L-Soft Listserv 至 1.8d 或更高版本（官方已在 2000 年 5 月发布修复补丁）。若无法立即升级，请在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面禁用 Listserv Web Archives 组件（通常为 /archives/ 或 /wa/ 路径），或在防火墙层面限制对 Listserv Web 管理端口（默认 80/443）的访问仅限可信管理 IP。同时建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面部署针对缓冲区溢出特征的防护规则，并限制 Listserv 服务进程权限以最小权限运行。立即升级至官方最新版本为最彻底修复方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0048.html","http://www.lsoft.com/news/default.asp?item=Advisory0","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1167","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19893","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0425.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0425","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0425.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0425.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Schmidt/CVE-2000-0425.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5984-j2rg-qm7x/GHSA-5984-j2rg-qm7x.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0425.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001346.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0346.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0337","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0337.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0335","title":"GNU glibc DNS 解析器预测性 ID 欺骗漏洞","description":"glibc 2.1.3 中的 DNS 解析器使用可预测的查询 ID，本地攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 DNS 响应包，利用可预测的 ID 字段实施 DNS 缓存投毒攻击，将用户请求重定向至恶意站点，导致信息泄露或中间人攻击。该漏洞影响使用 glibc 2.1.3 的 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地网络访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0335"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:30Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 DNS 事务 ID 可预测问题。如无法升级，可在本地 DNS 解析器（如 BIND）上启用 DNSSEC 并限制递归查询来源，同时使用 iptables 限制仅允许可信 DNS 服务器响应，降低欺骗攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1166"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0337.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0337.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0311","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0311.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0378","title":"RedHat Linux pam_console 模块本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 系统 pam_console PAM 模块存在设备文件描述符泄露漏洞。当用户登录时，pam_console 会对各类设备文件执行 chown 操作以赋予当前用户访问权限，但在用户注销后，之前打开的设备文件描述符并未被正确关闭，导致已注销用户仍可保持对设备的访问能力。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞，在注销后持续监控后续用户登录时的设备活动，从而窃取敏感信息（如键盘输入、屏幕输出等）。该漏洞影响 RedHat Linux 6.0/6.1/6.2 版本，攻击者需具备本地登录权限，无需额外认证即可实施监控，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0378"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"升级到包含修复的 pam 版本（pam-0.68 及以上），该版本在用户注销时正确关闭所有控制台设备文件描述符。如无法升级，可修改 /etc/security/console.perms 配置文件，移除 pam_console 对敏感设备（如 /dev/tty*、/dev/mouse、/dev/audio）的自动 chown 权限，或直接禁用 pam_console.so 模块（从 /etc/pam.d/login 中注释掉 session required pam_console.so 行）。对于仍在运行 Red Hat Linux 6.x 的系统，建议立即迁移到受支持的 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0023.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1176","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19900","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0378.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0378","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0378.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0378.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/711263a5c057385b05d3b3d477c7a317d9a9f37f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5949-54q2-grjg/GHSA-5949-54q2-grjg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0378.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bef28ef8-a6b1-4ae5-ae39-677d4184a250.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0311.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0311.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0311.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0294","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0294.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0303","title":"id软件 Quake3Arena 目录遍历漏洞","description":"id Software 出品的 Quake3 Arena 游戏存在目录遍历漏洞。恶意服务器运营者可向连接至服务器的客户端发送特制的包含 `../` 路径序列的数据包，绕过文件路径限制，实现对客户端文件系统中任意文件的读取或写入操作。攻击者无需认证，仅需诱使玩家连接至恶意服务器即可触发该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0303"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26Z","remediation":"升级 Quake III Arena 至 1.16 或更高版本，该版本修复了目录遍历漏洞。如无法升级，仅在客户端设置中禁用自动下载（set cl_allowDownload 0），并只连接可信任服务器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7531","http://www.quake3arena.com/news/index.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1169","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise50.php3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0303.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0303","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0303.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0303.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mcwg-hqg6-x568/GHSA-mcwg-hqg6-x568.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1029","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0303.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--904311c4-4e37-4b4f-b764-660a658f2bed.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0294.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0275","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0332","title":"UltraScripts UltraBoard 1.6 目录遍历漏洞","description":"UltraBoard 1.6 中的 UltraBoard.pl 或 UltraBoard.cgi CGI 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在路径名字符串中包含\"..\"（点点）并以空字节结尾的方式，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞允许攻击者获取敏感配置文件、密码文件等未授权信息，危害中等。攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，影响运行 UltraBoard 1.6 的 Web 服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0332"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:29Z","remediation":"立即升级 UltraBoard 至 1.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复输入验证缺陷。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 \"../\" 及空字节 (%00) 的请求路径；同时限制 CGI 脚本运行目录权限，确保 Web 用户无法读取 /etc/passwd 等系统敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1309","http://www.osvdb.org/4065","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1164","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000503091316.99073.qmail%40hotmail.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19890","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0332.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0332","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0332.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0332.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvp8-fccx-5j9w/GHSA-fvp8-fccx-5j9w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0332.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001342.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b24d4077-8f1a-4c11-ae3c-a83f91da091a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0275.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0275.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0470","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0433","title":"Suse Linux 权限提升漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 的 aaa_base 软件包将某些系统账户的主目录设置为 /tmp，本地用户可在 /tmp 下创建用户启动脚本（如 .profile、.bashrc 等），当这些系统账户登录或执行相关操作时会加载并执行攻击者植入的脚本，从而获得该系统账户的权限。该漏洞影响安装了有缺陷 aaa_base 包的 SuSE Linux 发行版，攻击者需具备本地访问权限并在 /tmp 目录写入恶意启动脚本，待目标系统账户登录或执行相关操作时触发代码执行，导致权限提升至对应系统账户权限，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0433"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:43Z","remediation":"立即升级 SUSE Linux aaa_base 包到修复版本（建议升级至 SuSE 6.4 或更高版本的修复版本），通过 YaST 在线更新或从 SUSE 官方 FTP 下载修补包安装。临时缓解措施：检查 /etc/passwd 中系统账户（如 uucp、news 等）的主目录是否指向 /tmp，若是则修改为 /var/spool/该账户 等安全目录；同时设置 /tmp 目录粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp）并限制普通用户在 /tmp 创建可执行脚本的权限（chmod 1777 /tmp），防止本地用户通过放置恶意 profile 脚本劫持系统账户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_47.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0433.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0433","https://github.co