的用户发送邮件；同时在网络防火墙层面限制对 Web Companion 端口（默认 80/443）的出站 SMTP 连接，阻止未授权的外部邮件转发。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.blueworld.com/blueworld/news/05.01.00-FM5_Security.html","http://www.filemaker.com/support/webcompanion.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0386.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0386","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0386.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0386.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2ab41bf860e3367de1bb9a028a62363062358f8d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2xgp-3983-29gm/GHSA-2xgp-3983-29gm.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88304/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0386.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/04a9a8381d346b006d2615d73d55f4e286759f63/2000.tsv","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0405.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0405.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0404","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0404.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0385","title":"FileMaker Pro Web Companion 安全绕过漏洞","description":"FileMaker Pro 5 Web Companion 组件存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 XML 发布功能或电子邮件功能绕过字段级数据库安全限制，实现对数据库字段的未授权修改。该漏洞影响 FileMaker Pro 5 版本，攻击者只需通过网络发送特制请求即可利用，无需复杂攻击条件，可能导致敏感数据被篡改。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0385"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36Z","remediation":"升级至 FileMaker Pro 5.5 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在 Web Companion 配置中禁用 XML 发布和电子邮件功能，并在防火墙层面限制对 Web Companion 端口（默认 80）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.blueworld.com/blueworld/news/05.01.00-FM5_Security.html","http://www.filemaker.com/support/webcompanion.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0385.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0385","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0385.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0385.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fc954c015ec74fa656f6d2cb3eaa86c83e860239/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3rvg-g59j-rvrh/GHSA-3rvg-g59j-rvrh.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88333/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0385.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f352dfaf39e3e89c1c3ab384d9e74e4219126910/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0404.toml"],"repo_exp_urls"